<title>CHINA: China sets tobacco purchase target for 1997.</title>
<headline>China sets tobacco purchase target for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has set a target to purchase 2.3785 million tonnes of tobacco leaf from farmers in 1997 and has urged producers to boost quality, the Economic Daily said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The area under tobacco was expected to be 1.3 million hectares in 1997, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Cigarette output this year would remain at the 1996 level of 34.25 milion cartons, it said but did not give further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
